# Postfix transport map — routes offsystem.fr straight to Mailu through
# the WireGuard mail-relay tunnel instead of doing normal MX/DNS lookups.
# Brackets around the host disable MX resolution: connect directly to
# that IP:port. 10.100.1.2 is the tunnel address of the "home" peer
# (dev machine today, mini PC after migration — see
# ../../wireguard-mail-relay/README.md), where scripts/mailu-portforward-setup.sh
# keeps port 25 forwarded to svc/mailu-front inside the cluster.
#
# Applied on the VPS with: postmap /etc/postfix/transport
offsystem.fr    smtp:[10.100.1.2]:25
